      "title": {
        "en": "Precise haircuts and dental care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently report tidy haircut styling, soft and shiny coats, and pleasant fragrances on their pets following each appointment. Dog parents also praise the anesthesia-free dental cleaning and thorough nail clipping, noting that pets look well-groomed and refreshed right outside their front door."
      }
    },
    {
