      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly and attentive mobile stylists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Groomers such as Camilo, Mara, and Nicolas receive frequent praise from pet parents for their polite demeanor and reliable communication. Clients value the stylists' willingness to listen to specific trimming requests and appreciate their proactive wellness advice regarding pet coat care and skin health."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
