      "title": {
        "en": "Calm and patient pet treatment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers often note the kind and calm approach groomers display when handling sensitive or nervous dogs. Pet owners appreciate that their dogs feel relaxed throughout the grooming process, returning home calm and happy without displaying signs of grooming stress."
      }
    }
  ],
